Respond with a single valid JSON object and nothing else. No markdown fences,
no commentary before or after.

{
  "answer": "your answer, with inline citations such as [T1] or [F1]",
  "citations": ["T1", "F1"]
}

"citations" must list every card label your answer relies on, without the
